      ":question/problem": "![](images/9b/9ba18ed92c092ceb26d1194504d88896f62a5eeddd2cded452d5fa5ee6ba1676.png)\n\nTo pay off a loan, Alex works two part-time jobs: C and D. He earns $$10$ per hour working at job C and $$20$ per hour at job D. In one week, Alex earned a total of $t$ dollars working both jobs. The graph above shows all possible combinations of hours Alex could have worked to earn $t$ dollars. What is the value of $t$?"
